{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "note": "忘却と沈黙。沈黙を語りの様態として読む今回の立場で、モチーフの境界を確かめた。", "read_id": "READ-20261025-eaf05f", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261025-c3a7b1", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-006", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "note": "訂正と抹消。訂正録（本文を書き換えない）を、隠さない手続きとして読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20261025-18ec41", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261025-c3a7b1", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-016", "type": "motif"}}
