{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "note": "伝聞と噂。取材源の秘匿と、この書庫の出どころ明示を対比した。", "read_id": "READ-20261025-d6c382", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261025-c3a7b1", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-20261024-1a8978", "type": "motif"}}
